## Project Overview

This is the Vibee project, an AI-powered Telegram bot built on the ElizaOS framework. The bot serves as an expert AI mentor for vibe-coding and modern development practices. It specializes in TypeScript, React, Bun, ElizaOS, AI agents and related technologies.

## Code Organization

The codebase follows a modular structure:

- `src/` - Main source code
  - `character.ts` - Defines the bot's personality and configuration
  - `index.ts` - Main entry point that bootstraps the bot
  - `plugin.ts` - Base starter plugin with example actions and providers
  - `telegram-*` files - Telegram-specific plugins
  - `training/` - Training-related modules for LoRA models
  - `ai-photoshop/` - AI image processing capabilities
  - `neurophoto/` - Image processing and AI integration
  - `selftest/` - Self-testing framework for automation
- `tests/` - Test suite with component and end-to-end tests
- `scripts/` - Development and deployment scripts
- `docs/` - Project documentation

## Development Commands

### Basic Commands
```bash
# Start development server with auto-reload
bun scripts/dev.ts

# Build project
bun run build

# Run tests
bun test

# Run specific test suites
bun test tests/unit/
bun test tests/telegram.integration.test.ts
bun test tests/telegram.e2e.test.ts
