## Deployment and Scripts

The project includes several scripts in `package.json`:

- `start`: Runs `scripts/start-single.sh`
- `stop`: Runs `scripts/stop.sh`
- `dev`: Uses `scripts/dev.ts` script
- `build`: Compiles the source code
- `test`: Executes all tests using Bun's test runner
- `lint`: Formats code using Prettier
- `format`: Applies code formatting via Prettier